window.products.push({"id":295037,"name":"BTTN Black Fabric Shower Curtain, Ombre Linen Textured Weighted Cloth Shower Curtain Set with Plastic Hooks, Machine Washable, Water Repellent, Hotel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hu38-fhHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛁【Elegant & Luxury Black Ombre Design】: As a decorative shower curtain, it features with vivid black ombre pattern printed with advanced printing technology. The natural gradient effect of black makes it pretty. This chic design shower curtain adds an artistic touch to your bathroom, allowing you to enjoy a luxurious hotel bath at home. 🛁【Premium Quality Linen Textured Shower Curtain】: This simple shower curtain is made of 100% premium polyester fabric, which is non-toxic, eco-friendly, non-smell and non-fading. Features an advanced slub weave with subtle embossing and cross-thread texture. This modern fabric shower curtain is perfect for apartment, hotel, spa, camper, RV, dorm, school shower, gazebo, athletic club, gym and everywhere else you need a shower curtain. 🛁【Standard Size】: 72\" W x 72\" L; 180GSM (Gram Per Square Meter), about 0.8 pounds heavier than normal 100GSM fabric shower curtains; Each Shower Curtain Set includes 1 black ombre shower curtain and ★12 Plastic Hooks★. 12 Metal grommet holes promote easier hanging and long-lasting strength. Suitable for most standard sized bathrooms and easy to install. 🛁【Protect Privacy & Water Repellent】: High-density and heavy-weight woven fabric construction with weighted hem provide maximum protection for your privacy and prevent the curtain from billowing; There is a water-repellent coating on the surface, which can promote the formation of water droplets, causing water to roll off the surface quickly, keeps your bathroom dry and clean. 🛁【Easy Care and After Sale】: Machine washable in cold water and hang to dry. Steamer or light iron can be used to smooth out creases. We are industry and trade integration, dedicating to provide high-quality fabric shower curtains. IF THERE IS ANY QUALITY PROBLEM, WE WILL PROVIDE REPLACEMENT OR REFUND WITHIN 60 DAYS FROM THE DATE OF PURCHASE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hu38-fhHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BTTN","source_asin":"B0BK98VPG2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK98VPG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK98VPG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
