window.products.push({"id":295144,"name":"joybest Luxury Plush Shaggy Duvet Cover Set Fluffy Comforter Ultra Soft Velvet Bedding Sets 3 Pieces (1 Faux Fur Duvet Cover + 2 Faux Fur Pillow case)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AyK22E8kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY & SOFT DUVER COVER SET: The front of plush comforter and pillowcase are made of 100% polyester microfiber plush, and the back is super soft crystal velvet fabric, creating a warm and inviting space for sleeping and stretching. Anti-fading, anti-wrinkle, anti-pilling, and also provide the best warmth and comfort. ELEGANT LOOK & PERFECT GIFT: This exquisite and dreamy fluffy duvet cover perfectly combines simple colors with modern home style, bringing surprises to any room or sofa of yours. This duvet cover set is a great gift for everyone, every holiday and special occasion. EXQUISITE WORKMANSHIP: The plush quilt set adopts high-stretch yarn and clear stitches, which is more durable; the hidden zipper closure design is easier and faster to seal your quilt, comforter or duvet than the conventional button closure, and it is easy to separate and wash, all corners and Internal ties on the sides hold the duvet in place. MULTI PURPOSE: In summer, it can be used as a bed blanket alone to provide you with enough comfort. In winter, just insert the quilt into the duvet cover, and you can easily embrace the warmth without fear of the cold. Twin:1x duvet cover 68\"x 90\", 1x pillowcase 20\"x 26\". Queen: 1x duvet cover 90\"x 90\", 2x pillowcases 20\"x 26\". King:1x duvet cover 104\"x 90\", 2x pillowcases 20\"x 36\". MACHINE WASH & EASY CARE: Turn the plush side inside first to avoid damage. Machine wash in a gentle cycle or dry clean. Dry at low temperature or dry flat. Avoid hanging to dry, otherwise it will cause deformation. Don't bleach. Do not iron. We recommend washing before the first use because it will come off a bit when the product is cut and is more skin-friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AyK22E8kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"joybest","source_asin":"B09DYH8R28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYH8R28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYH8R28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
