window.products.push({"id":295154,"name":"Air Fryer Oven, 6-in-1 Toaster Oven 23 Quart, Airfryer Toaster Oven For Roast, Bake, Broil, Stainless Steel Accessories Included, Convection Oven Coun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QBfvCAYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-EFFICIENCY COUNTERTOP OVEN - Moss & Stone multi-functional air fryer convection oven can allow you to bake, broil, dehydrate, toast & air frying. Select a range temperature that suits you up to 450ºF. 1700W motor helps to cook food efficiently in the healthiest way possible by cutting over 85% of fats. Luxury style with three knobs enables you easy to select the demand cooking time, cooking method, and cooking temperature. Cooking is faster, and no preheating is required. HEALTHY LOW OIL AIR FRYER - Use the air fryer toaster oven combo to create healthy and delicious food; fry with air but no need oil, let’s enjoy your deep fried and crispiness food, but without the calories or smell associated with deep frying! EASY TO CLEAN - The air fry oven comes with many accessories - Oven Rack to bake chicken wings and toast or dried fruit, Bake Pan to bake the pizza or roast, Fryer basket for Fried French fries & Pan handle. All are easy to removable, so it’s easy to clean up & dishwasher safe. Non-stick coating provides excellent food release and easy to be clean up. SUITABLE FAMILY SIZE & SPACE SAVING DESIGN - 23QT large air fryer allows you to prepare family-sized quantities for up to 10 people at once. For added safety, it has a power switch indicator light when operating, but when the oven door is opened, all operations will be auto shut off, and also, when cooking time up, it will have a ready bell voice from the 0-60 timer mode, simple and stylish design, suitable for any home kitchen. CUSTOMER SUPPORT - We at Moss & Stone offer top-quality toaster ovens countertop (ETL Certified) And a 1-Year warranty with top-of-the-line customer service, which you won't get with other brands that sell toaster ovens & kitchen essentials!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QBfvCAYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moss & Stone","source_asin":"B09L72YVZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L72YVZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L72YVZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
