window.products.push({"id":295279,"name":"Star Coffee Powerful Handheld Milk Frother with Stand-Bonus Scoop w/Bag Clip, Micro Cloth & eBook included - Stainless Steel Whisk - Ideal Mixer for C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MqWvxva7L._AC_SL1390_.jpg","description":"Make an unforgettable cup of coffee that even a Starbucks barista would envy!GREAT BONUS: Every order also comes standard with a useful stainless steel Coffee Scoop with a bag clip to maintain the taste and aroma of your coffee, a durable Microfiber Cloth to keep the whisk shiny and a comprehensive “Guide To A Wonderful Coffee Experience” eBook, with magnificent tips, tricks and techniques that will turn you into a world-class barista!The only thing better than a deliciously sweet cup of coffee in the morning is adding a warm, frothy foam to the top! And now, thanks to the Star Coffee Milk Frother, you can add the perfect whipped foam topping to your favorite blend in less than 20 seconds!One-Handed OperationThanks to a sleek, lightweight design and one-button operation, you can use our battery-powered electric milk frother on hot or cold milk, to mix a variety of delicious drinks and cocktails, and to beat eggs or thicken soups.Versatile Kitchen ToolUse it to make your kids milkshakes, put a little foam on your espresso, or just whip up some homemade salad dressing; made of premium stainless steel, our latte maker cleans up easily with just a little hot water so you can use it again when you’re ready!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MqWvxva7L._AC_SL1390_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Star Coffee","source_asin":"B01J82C832","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J82C832","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J82C832","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
