window.products.push({"id":295323,"name":"Floating Shelves Wall Mounted Set of 3, Rustic Wood Wall Storage Shelves for Bedroom, Living Room, Bathroom, Kitchen, Office, with Adhesive Hooks and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AubhaIWuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modern Wall Mounted Shelves - Made up of wood boards and black metal frames, simple and elegant, matches any rustic, modern, or minimalist home decor. Multifunctional Storage - Perfect for displaying and holding collectibles, photos, books, toys, artwork, trophies, small plants and more. Also, installed in bathroom, it also suitable for putting toiletries, such as shampoo, conditioner, shower gel,etc Easy Double Installation - Offer two unique display forms, you could choose paste no-trace hook on the tiled wall for hanging, or use the included nails to nail to the wall Floating Shelves Sets - 2 Pcs medium wall mounted shelves measure 13.7'' (L) x 5.9''(H) x 4.3''(W), 1 small measuring in 9.8'' (L) x 5.5''(H) x 3.9''(W). Also included necessary mounting small parts. Great Decoration - Ideal for hanging on bedroom, living room, office for revamping a living room wall, maximize kitchen storage. A nice way to clear up the clutter, add a unique charm to your walls.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AubhaIWuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAMAYKIM","source_asin":"B08B3MQJN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3MQJN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3MQJN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":295324,"name":"nuLOOM Michiko Braided Chindi Cotton Runner Rug, 2' 6\" x 8', Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1zhM6DbyuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability., The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1zhM6DbyuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B07WX629CX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WX629CX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WX629CX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":295325,"name":"Presto 09909 Pressure Cooker Canner Gasket Sealing Ring & Auto Air Vent Genuine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717gLioTcoL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The sealing ring fits around the inside rim of the cover and forms a pressure tight seal between the cover and the body of the pressure canner during canning and cooking To install the new parts, the old ones should be removed and the new ones should be inserted into the appropriate slots in the lid The Presto 09909 Pressure Cooker Canner Gasket Sealing Ring & Auto Air Vent Genuine is a high-quality replacement part that is designed to fit a variety of Presto pressure cookers and canners. It is commonly used in home kitchens for cooking a variety of foods quickly and efficiently, using steam pressure to cook food at high temperatures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717gLioTcoL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Presto","source_asin":"B0139N2P6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0139N2P6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0139N2P6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
