window.products.push({"id":295393,"name":"Hyoola Black Pillar Candles 2x4 Inch - 4 Pack Unscented Pillar Candles - European Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KSHDB4XnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hyoola European Made Pillar Candles are the perfect addition to any occasion, creating a warm and inviting ambiance that lights up any environment. About This Product: - Black Pillar Candle Pack  - Elegant Pillar Candles  - Made In Europe by A Brand You Can Trust  - Packed securely in a cardboard box  - Lead-free 100% Cotton Wick, non-toxic  - Unscented Candles  - Dripless Pillar Candles  - Indoor / Outdoor Use  - 25 Hour Burn Time  - 4 Pack  - High Grade Paraffin Wax Great For Decorating Special Events Such As - Weddings  - Holiday Dinners  - Home candle Decor  - Parties  - Spa's  - Bath Candle Set  - Event planners  - Unity candle  - Restaurants  - Emergency Candles For Blackouts ▪️ 2-inch diameter x 4-inch height (50mm x 100mm) SafeCandle Certified and Patented Self-extinguishing pillars with an integrated wick holder, which stops the wax supply to the wick and thus “stifles” the candle. This innovative and patented system is DEKRA tested and 100% made in EU!  The burning wick cannot tip over due to the integrated wick holder and extinguishes by itself after burning. In addition, the wick holder does not transmit any heat downwards!  Candlesticks can always be cleaned without residue, since no liquid wax remains on the plates. This considerably reduces the risk of fire. Our SafeCandle products can be attached directly to wreaths or arrangements with a floral wire. Invest in the best! Hyoola Decorative Pillars are made from natural wax to ensure premium quality. Ignite your creativity with Hyoola Candles ! Great quality materials mixed with incredible utility will brighten up your days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KSHDB4XnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B0979M2V2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0979M2V2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0979M2V2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":295394,"name":"SlipX Solutions Microban-Infused Fabric Shower Curtain Liner 70\" x 72\", White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51echL4GStL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SlipX Solutions' fabric bathtub and shower curtain liner is the only liner with Microban product protection material specially designed to prevent unwanted buildup and smell. Microban protection works at a cellular level to continually disrupt the creation and reproduction of unwanted buildup that typically contaminates a shower curtain liner. The technology operates a multi-modal attack by damaging the protein, cell membrane, DNA, and internal systems, causing it to die. SlipX Solutions shower liner measures 70\" x 72\" to fit standard-sized bathtub openings. Its lightweight design allows it to easily work with a decorative shower curtain or as a standalone shower liner, while its heavy-duty composition makes it durable and dependable. This super soft microfiber tub curtain liner comes with long-lasting and durable stainless steel grommets to protect against accidental rips and tears and makes it easy to hang on both straight or curved shower rods. The fabric material is made of brushed polyester which not only feels great but looks great as a neutral bathroom décor complement. It also slides easily out of the way when entering or exiting the shower or tub. Includes strong hold magnetic weights at the bottom to prevent leaks, splashes, and drafts by holding this plastic shower liner close to the tub surface. The perfect shower and bath accessory designed to be tear free and longer lasting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51echL4GStL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SlipX Solutions","source_asin":"B0147162CM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0147162CM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0147162CM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
