window.products.push({"id":295464,"name":"Electric Rechargeable Salt and Pepper Grinder Set USB Stainless Steel Salt Grinder Pepper Mill with Salt Grinder Adjustable Coarseness Gravity Automat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Eamy26vVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PROFESSIONAL AND HIGH QUALITY】VEVOK CHEF electric salt and pepper grinder is made of 304 stainless steel and borosilicate glass material.The capcity of the electric spice grinder glass is 140 ml.The transparent thick glass body and the glass container which provides long-term durability.【SALT AND PEPPER SHAKER GLASS REPLACEMENT】.The extral glass bottle has a shaker lid and Sealed lid together. You can use for your spice shaker or the spice container. 【ONE HAND OPERATION USB CHARGING】our rechangeable pepper grinder can use USB charging.You can charge the pepper grinder in advance.The electric salt and pepper shaker can continuously work for 1 hour by charging once. The automated design is powered by gravity with just push the botton.The labor-save and efficient salt mill pepper grinder will make you cooking experience more effortless and enjoyable.The grinder must be a good kitchen help. 【AUTOMATIC AND EASY TO USE 】The stainless steel pepper grinder has a switch button on the cap.You can press the button, and then flipped the grinder .The spices powder will come out from top.Pay attention to press the button to turn off the grinder avoiding waste the power by accidental grinding.【USB Charge Cable】We have a usb charge cable, glass jar replacement and grinder together . 【STEPLESS ADJUSTABLE CERAMIC COARSENESS】Our salt and pepper mill set can adjust to every coarse you want. The ceramic grinding merchanism can grinde the spice from fine to coarse. And the ceramic grinder is non-corrosive and won't abosorb the flavor of the spice.The VEVOK CHEF kitchen grinder is suitable for various spices,such as Black peppercorn ,himalayan salt,salt crystal etc 【LIFETIME GUARANTEE】: We offer you a lifetime guarantee. IF you have questions about our salt and pepper grinder, we will offer your after-sale service. 【KITCHEN GIFT】: the salt and pepper shakers set have color box package, so it will be a perfect choice for birthday, housewarming, wedding, birthday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Eamy26vVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOK CHEF","source_asin":"B08JQ39MGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JQ39MGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JQ39MGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
