window.products.push({"id":295467,"name":"3 Stems Faux Pampas Grass Large & Boho Wooden Beads - 43-Inch Fluffy Pink Pampas Gras Decor Tall - Bulk of Long Decorative Artificial Pompous Grass La","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nh-C1kREL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BOHO DECORA.Chic and minimalistic, practical and hypoallergenic, stylish and elegant set of artificial pompas gras suitable to decorate home, be it a living room, kitchen, bedroom or bathroom, as well as photo studio or office room. It is a perfect feather décor for vase of any size due to versatile stems. No mess or shed of dried pampass grasss. No need in water, filler or foam to keep it fluffy. INTERIOR STYLING.Our variations of cream/beige, green and pink-toned pompass gress is perfect for interior styling. Just imagine a boho vase with papas grazs placed in a corner of your white-wall room. Isn’t it a marvelous floral art of nature brought from outside inside to make your place, be it a kitchen or living room, elegant and luxurious? It will completely transform your space giving it an effortless look. SPECIAL PACKAGING & PERFECT GIFT.Being securely packed your artificial pampa grass will be delivered­­ safe and sound to your home. Specially designed packaging makes it the perfect ready-to-go gift for a wedding or housewarming party, Mother's Day or Valentine's Day or any other special event. BACKGROUND FOR INSTAGRAM PHOTOS & TIKTOK VIDEOS.Pompuss grass has captured attention not only by interior designers. Photographers are using it to create a special atmosphere on the photos as well. Look! It’s quite a pretty background for your instagram photos. Faux pompus grass looks amazing! All you need is just to try. FEATHER DECOR FOR VASE.The final step to create a bohemian atmosphere at home is to find suitable vases, shorten or bend the stems to the desired size and place it at the required place. Here you are - a chic Boho theme for your room is ready. COMING SOON.To make your life colorful pampus gass artaficial in silver, red, black, blue, brown, gold, grey, orange, purple, white and yellow is coming soon for you to mix and combine. pumps, pampuss","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nh-C1kREL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Porto Calma","source_asin":"B09KDGGQ7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KDGGQ7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KDGGQ7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
