window.products.push({"id":295559,"name":"Nostalgia MyMini Single Coffee Maker, Brews K-Cup & Other Pods, Serves up to 14 Ounces, Tea, Chocolate, Hot Cider, Lattes, Reusable Filter Basket Incl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KXywRIRRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Nostalgia MyMini Single Serve Coffee Maker is ideal for on-the-go lifestyles. It allows you to make a personal cup of coffee at home, in the office, dorm, or camper. It’s compact and lightweight and can fit any space, big or small. It works with any K-Cup® or coffee pods and includes a reusable filter basket for you to use your own coffee grounds. It also provides a quick serving of hot water for noodles, soup, tea, hot chocolate, or any other hot water need. Looking for a useful and unique gift? This product can bring a smile to any coffee or tea drinker!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KXywRIRRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nostalgia","source_asin":"B0BBWYLC53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBWYLC53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBWYLC53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":295560,"name":"Zober Wooden Hangers 20 Pack - Non Slip Wood Clothes Hanger for Suits, Pants, Jackets w/ Bar & Cut Notches - Heavy Duty Clothing Hanger Set - Coat Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J3c0O-XCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE - With clear, varnished wood, a 360 degree chrome hook, grooved pant bar, and contoured shoulder line, these closet hangers have made even the most finicky clothing easy to hang up! DURABLE DESIGN - Don't let the elegance fool you - these suit hangers are no joke. The smooth, splinter-free finish on this wood hanger set is built to withstand even your heaviest jackets or dresses. ADDED PANT BAR - Our suit hangers for men and women include a sturdy pant bar for clothing sets. The firm grip on these wood hangers for clothes keeps your pants or skirts securely in place. CONTOURED SHOULDER - Looking for coat, sweater, or shirt hangers that don't leave lasting bumps? The curved shoulder on this wooden coat hanger keeps shoulder bulges at bay! CUT NOTCHES - Sick of watching your clothes slip off your old, heavy hangers in bulk? These clothing hangers come with 2 precisely-cut notches, so you can keep even the silkiest camisoles in place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J3c0O-XCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOBER","source_asin":"B0B8PG1JBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8PG1JBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8PG1JBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":295561,"name":"SKINNY TUMBLERS (4 pack) - 20oz Stainless Steel Double Wall Insulated Tumblers with Lids and Straws | Skinny Travel Mug, Straw Cleaner INCLUDED | Tumb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CdImISKhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY: Sleek and stylish, these 20 oz. skinny tumblers are great for enjoying your favorite drink on-the-go. This set includes 4 tumblers with lids and straws, along with 4 bonus straw cleaners. Reusable, unbreakable, and easy to wash, these tumblers are a safer and eco-friendly alternative to plastic cups and bottles PERFECT FOR DIYERS: Create your own custom tumblers with this convenient 4-pack. Perfect for your vinyl projects, the tumblers feature a smooth, 8” tall surface that works great with all brands of vinyl. INSULATED TUMBLERS: Keep your drinks hot or cold for hours with our premium stainless steel tumblers. Double walled vacuum insulated for optimal temperature control; these 20 oz tumblers will keep your drinks at just the right temperature for up to 8-12 hours. GREAT FOR GIFTING: Our insulated tumblers make a great birthday, housewarming, or Christmas gift. This set of 4 tumblers is perfect for gifting to multiple people, and you can add your own design for an extra special personalized gift. ECO-FRIENDLY & NON-TOXIC: Made from non-toxic, BPA-free material, our skinny tumblers are a great choice for you and the environment. The insulated stainless steel material will keep your drinks cold and the flavor intact. A much healthier choice than plastic tumblers and bottles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CdImISKhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalization Lab","source_asin":"B09VSBW51F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSBW51F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSBW51F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":295562,"name":"ReynosoHomeDecor 14x30 Inch Rectangular Throw Pillow Insert Form","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DEiUAcebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About These Inserts: These white cotton blend insert pillows are handmade and made to order by our shop. They are filled with synthetic down-like non-allergenic polyester fibers designed to give your pillows a soft and sumptuous yet firm feel. Sizing: This 14\"x30\" pillow insert will provide a regular fit for a 14\"x30\" cover, a full fit for a 14\"x29\" cover, and a plump fit for a 13\"x29\" cover. Shipping: All pillows are made and shipped within two to three business days via the shipping method you choose at purchase. Custom Pillows: These pillows are made after you purchase them. Thus, if you'd like your pillow a little fuller or less full, send us a request - we should be able to accommodate you. Washing Instructions: These inserts are machine washable and dry-able. We recommend cold water and the softer and fluff cycles. Please wash alone or with other white items. After washing and drying, a good \"fluff\" will bring the insert back to normal. Returns: We accept all returns - no questions asked - within 30 days of purchase. However, we do not provide return labels nor pay for return shipping. If you have any comments, questions, and/or concerns please send us an email before you make a purchase. Thank you for visiting our Amazon Shop!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DEiUAcebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ReynosoHomeDecor","source_asin":"B00OC89AO8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OC89AO8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OC89AO8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
