window.products.push({"id":295649,"name":"ATsense Pom Pom Fringe Comforter Set King Size Sage Green, 3 Pieces Aesthetic Cute Boho Ball Pom Bedding Set, All Season Vintage Lightweight Soft Micr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aMkZPvaGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable and Soft: ATsense pom pom fringe comforter is made of premium microfiber outer fabric for a soft and lightweight, and king size comforter set filled with ultra-soft microfiber, cozy and warm suitable for all-season, keeps you cool in the summer, dry and warm in the winter. Pom Pom Fringe Design: Sage green comforter king size cute and stylish pom pom design fits any room style and adds a cute and boho style to your bedroom or guest room. Atsense comforter king size is a great gift idea for men and women at the special festival, such as housewarming, Christmas, Thanksgiving, and birthdays. Built to Last: Our king size comforter set are hidden neat stitches, keep filling well-distributed, and prevent shifting and bunching. The boho comforter can be used as a duvet insert with 4 corner tabs or work as a comforter alone. What You Can Get: 3 Pieces King Size Comforter Set Includes 1 Comforter King Size(104\"x 90\"), 2 Pillow Cases(20\"x36\"). Easy Care: Machine washable, tumble dry at low temperature. No shrinking, No color fading, and No unravelling after washing. Do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aMkZPvaGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATsense","source_asin":"B0BDHSZ2G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDHSZ2G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDHSZ2G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":295650,"name":"4R Cooling Side Sleeper Pillow - Shredded Memory Foam Pillows Standard Size - Adjustable Bed Pillow for Sleeping - Bamboo Pillow for Back/Stomach/Side","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LblVRhu3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☁️【OEKO-TEX Certified】The memory foam pillows uses a new type of high-performance fabric certified by OEKO-TEX, which is perfectly combined by polyester, bamboo silk and ice line. Cooling touch, moisture absorption and perspiration, durability of polyester, softness and comfort of silk. High breathable 3D mesh is used in the middle of the pillow, which is twice as breathable as ordinary pillows, better dissipates heat and provides more comfortable and longer sleep time. ☁️【Cooling Gel】4R bed pillow is made of high quality crushed foam to allow air to pass through each area and infuse the foam with temperature-regulating cooling gel particles to reduce excess heat build-up while providing the neck, shoulders, back and head the best support for a more comfortable deep sleep.Its traditional pillow shape keeps your new pillow fit in less time than contoured pillows. ☁️【Adjustable Height】Add and/or remove foam padding to find the perfect comfort level and enjoy a personalized sleep experience, whether side sleepers, stomach sleepers, back sleepers can be supported. ☁️【Machine Washable】Don't worry that the pillow is difficult to clean. This sleep pillow can be thrown straight into the washing machine and dried for extra fluffy effect! At the same time, it also supports removing the zipper pillowcase and cleaning it separately. ☁️【Never Go Flat】 Composed of millions of microfiber and memory foam, the pillow has a pleasant slow response time that drops naturally. Packed in vacuum compression, when taken out of the package, please place the pillow in the air for 24 hours, pat it properly, the pillow will slowly expand completely, and then you can enjoy a fluffy and breathable memory foam pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LblVRhu3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4R","source_asin":"B0B3MKTJHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3MKTJHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3MKTJHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
