window.products.push({"id":295729,"name":"Dried Flowers Baby's Breath Bouquet - 3000+ Pure White Dried Babys Breath Bulk, 17'' Real Gypsophila 2 Bundles, Natural Dry Flowers for DIY Vase, Flor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xW+rfPH5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[100% Natural White Baby's Breath] - Unlike artificial baby's breath flowers, we selectively harvest real flowers and use advanced bleaching technology to give our product a unique pure white color. Perfect for use in any dried flower arrangement, bringing natural elegance to your life. [Exquisite Packaging] - 3000+ Million Star flowers include 2 bouquets of gypsophila and gorgeous gift packaging. Each bundle is tied with a beautiful ribbon, making it the perfect gift. If you receive them with scattered flower heads falling off, please do not throw away these angels that came across the ocean. It can be used for hand-made such as dried flower bouquet matching, epoxy craft, DIY journal, etc. [Premium Dried Flowers] - Customer first is Glicrili's motto, so each bundle is carefully selected. Our babys breath flowers are grown in the mountains of Yunnan, where the climate is excellent. It is dried and bleached using advanced non-toxic and eco-friendly technology. This flower bouquet will accompany you through the seasons without fading. [Care Tips] - Dried flower bouquets are shipped over long distances and have a delicate nature, so please treat them gently. Keep out of harsh sunlight and away from humidity to avoid damage and discoloration. Dried flowers should never be placed in or near water. They can keep their original color after a long stay, suitable for home, store, gift box, wedding, and party decoration. [Gift of Love] - Pure white baby‘s breath flowers mean purity and romance. Our dried babys breath will send this love to family and friends at weddings, holidays, anniversaries, birthdays, and other events. It will brighten your life and give your house a romantic atmosphere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xW+rfPH5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glicrili","source_asin":"B0BNBHZ96C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNBHZ96C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNBHZ96C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
