window.products.push({"id":295786,"name":"CASAVIDA 2 Tier Fridge Soda Can Organizer Stackable Beverage Can Rack Dispenser Rolling Food Can Organizer Holder for Pantry Refrigerator Cabinet, Bro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wKuqh13ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CASAVIDA stackable can organizer--The essential soda can dispenser for home, office and dormitory. If you are tired of seeing all the cans messy on the kitchen cabinet, refrigerator, or pantry You might as well try ordering our can organizer holder to storage them. What's the flash point about this can dispenser rack? 1. Large capacity Each 2-tier stacking can dispenser max holds 20 cans(standard 12OZ soada can). Wide range of applications, can hold most soda cans, beverage cans, small food cans, beer, etc. 2. Sturdy and Durable The surface adopts powder spraying, easy to clean, rust-proof and dirt-resistant. It is the best can dispenser for refrigerators, countertops, kitchen cabinets, and pantry. 3. Inclined design The inclined and rolling shelf makes the storage no longer monotonously placed flat. The upward slope of the port can ensure that the cans will not slip out. The baffle is also designed on the back, so you don’t have to worry about falling out during the sliding process. 4. Non-slip pads We have distributed non-slip rubber pads for each shelf, which can protect the shelf and the desktop well, and also make the shelf more stable during use and will not move too much. Warm Tips 1. The track width is 4.92\"L, applicable can size is up to 4.92\"H x 2.95\"W(please see the picture for details). 2. The package comes with a very detailed instruction manual and all the accessories needed for installation. The installation manual clearly explain which part is A which part is B, and where part A should be placed. Specification Dimensions: 11 x 14.09 x 9.45 inches Weight: 4.4 lbs（2kg/set） Quantity: 2 pack Material: Metal Color: Brown Package Content Rolling can rack organize *1 L16mm cross wire *8 L20mm cross machine wire*4 Non-slip stickers*8 nut*4","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wKuqh13ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASAVIDA","source_asin":"B0BML6RQK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BML6RQK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BML6RQK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
