window.products.push({"id":295927,"name":"Glass Display Cabinet w/ 2 Doors 4 Shelves Display Case w/Handles,Locks & Anti-tipping Device,Glass Shelves/Curio Cabinet for Architecture/Model/Toys/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dJfpMZD2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕【Accent Glass Cabinet】Compared with the previous products,This HomVent 4-Shelf glass display cabinet with 2 glass door adopt stable metal buckle,which can increase the stability of the glass cabinet,and rust-resist round handle.Meanwhile more easy installation way are adopted.Making the display shelf can be sets up in few minutes.In addition,It is suggested to place the heavy item of the below shelf to improve the cabinet stability. 💕【Practical Glass Display Cabine】This HomVent glass cabinet can be used as a showcase in living room, a wine cabinet in the kitchen, modern bookshelf in the study room, or a glass display rack in your collection room! In a words,this glass display cabinet is great for displaying books, photos, medals, action figures, wine bottles, toys, artwork, decorations ect.Bring this glass display shelf to your home just now,you will never feel regret for this option. 💕【Sturdy Curio Cabinet】The displaying curio cabinet is made of 0.16\" thick tempered glass panel and solid wood boards,which ensure the stability of the glass cabinet.Adjustable feet weight capacity:440lb.The glass layers in the curious cabinet can load weight up to 15LBS.What's more,Anti-overturning device can better fix glass display case. you can easily display your favorite collection in this beautiful glass display case while keep it from dust and lost. 💕【Spacious Display Space】 4-glass shelf design provide sufficient storage space to display photos, books, action figures, wine and whisky.and the glass door can efficiently protect your cherish collection from dust without compromising aesthetics.The metal handle will make it easier for you to open the wine cabinet.The transparent frameless design of the bright glass cabinet makes you clearly see your favorite antiques, books, toys, and is suitable for any family-style. 💕【More Safety Design】The silver handle on the cabinet facilitate your switch.The lock design can protect your collections from accident losting.anti-dumping device make the cabinet more stable than former version,it can efficiently prevent tipping over of your favorite collections.There are bumper strips between glass plates and sides for maximum safety.This glass cabinet is durable and practical for everyday use.If the display case you recieved is broken,don't worry,just contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dJfpMZD2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomVent","source_asin":"B0B6BVNZCF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6BVNZCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6BVNZCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
