window.products.push({"id":295975,"name":"My Egyptian Giza Cotton Sheets King Size, 16 Inches Extra Deep Pocket for Thick Dream Mattress, 100% Giza Long-Staple Cotton Giza Cotton Bed Sheet Sof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514RPCJn+OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Deep Pockets With 360° All-Around Elastic For A Snug Fit:- KING Dream BedSheet Giza Cotton Set includes 1 Fitted sheet: 78 inches x 80 inches, 1 Flat sheet: 102 inches x 108 inches and 2 Pillowcases: 20 inches x 40 inches. Fully elasticized fitted sheet provide 16-inch-deep pockets are generously sized to accommodate both deep and pillow-top mattresses. Flat sheet and pillowcases come with a tailored hem stitch giving them a classy look. My Dream Egyptian Sheet Gizas Cotton 4 PC Set - When crafting our authentic, Dream Premium Cotton Sheet sets, we use only pure, 100% long staple Giza Egyptian Cotton Yarns, which are renowned for their superior quality and durability and must for Giza Egyptian Sheets. A sateen finish offers a lustrous look like silk or satin, yet more breathable and natural. Our fabrics are of the highest quality and used in Hotel Quality sheets as well. Luxury You Can Touch and Feel:- Create a welcoming environment and a restful feeling in the bedroom with this TOP QUALITY and AFFORDABLE Bedding Sheets. You’ll find yourself getting a restful night of sleep on our comfortable bed sheets. The 100% Giza Cotton Fabric is Our Perfect Solution to Luxurious and Affordable Bedding. Its Long Staple Cotton Makes it Ultra Soft, Breathable Weave that is Stain Resistant. Its Sateen Weave Gives them Luxurious Finish. Sustainable & Eco-Friendly:- When crafting our authentic, High quality sets, we use only pure, 100% long staple Egyptian cotton yarns, which are renowned for their superior quality and durability. A Sateen Finish Offers a Lustrous Look Like Silk or Satin, Yet More Breathable and Natural. Made of Natural Fibers, these Top-Performance Sheets are the Ultimate Sheets for Night Sweats. Ideal for all Types of Bedroom or Guest Room, New Appartment Bedroom. Care Guide:- Machine wash in warm and line dry or tumble dry on low, do not bleach. When machine drying, never dry at high temperatures. If your dryer is adjustable, use the medium fan and spin speed. For bed linens it is important to take out from dryer before completely dry, gently fold then iron, if needed. Egyptian Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a few washes to experience the silky softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514RPCJn+OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Femini Fashion","source_asin":"B09CNLVZXQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-295975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CNLVZXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CNLVZXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
